tclk-py

An independent Python implementation of the tclk/1 wire format and state
machine.

The tclk/1 protocol, its specification and its reference implementation are the
work of Flop Labs and are published at https://github.com/flop-labs/tclk under
the Apache License 2.0.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or maintained by Flop Labs.
It is a separate implementation written against the published specification and
checked against the cross-implementation vectors that repository ships.
